@startuml
 title Person creation event flow
participant "ms-user-management" as UM
database "SQL Server" as DB
queue Kafka as KFK
participant "ms-iam" as IAM

UM -> DB: INSERT Person
UM -> KFK: publishes student/driver/admin/parent.created
KFK -> IAM: Consume evento (grupo iam)
IAM -> DB: creates or updates Profile
IAM -> KFK: publishes profile.created
@enduml

